<p>President Trump said Iran wants an agreement, but that the terms now on the table are &quot;not good enough yet,&quot; signaling that Washington is not ready to support a ceasefire as the conflict continues. Multiple reports also said efforts to begin ceasefire talks have been rejected for now, while sources cited in Reuters-partner coverage said Iran insists there can be no truce until US and Israeli strikes stop. Together, those positions suggest the war is entering a more entrenched phase, with both Washington and Tehran showing little sign of softening their stance right away.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/exsHz5Au-tUqTi42Cmf4KUhh97Aahu3nRww2ndSXxbsqP0TEzFnmmZdMA7MKHmY5xlPli9zopJzHKkHL8KCoJn0R0h7wlD0vwQAGYKynDiEkL_BI3TvOufHD3TO9Xvjwe4Y0Z-LtGbsiH3jpqSBRZM2hrSJOQwDPCuXbI65GQR8D5G9aCtmyjQYMsX51c37nkCI0SQdCOiLEgZnrHeOxoZIdbTiR31HQckXEf7KwmlcIJA1LsmpDxiwbuCIvMTu1DeQA3xYRPa0v5aLYwA' alt='An Iranian man goes into his house, which was destroyed by a strike, in Tehran on March 14.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Unclear US benchmark: Trump said the current peace terms were not good enough but did not say what Washington would accept instead.</li><li>Regional spillover: DW said Iran has kept striking Gulf countries and threatened to widen attacks if Washington targets Iranian energy infrastructure.</li></ul><blockquote>The terms aren&#x27;t good enough yet - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>United States: Trump rejected the current peace terms without saying what terms would satisfy Washington, leaving the US endgame unclear even as it keeps up pressure on Tehran. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-trump-says-peace-deal-terms-not-good-enough-yet/live-76363921'>DW</a>, <a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/not-good-enough-trump-says-iran-wants-peace-but-us-demands-stronger-terms-first-13989630.html'>Firstpost</a>)</li><li>Iran: DW reported that Tehran warned it could widen attacks if Washington targets Iranian energy infrastructure, a sign that retaliation could spread beyond the current battlefield. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-trump-says-peace-deal-terms-not-good-enough-yet/live-76363921'>DW</a>)</li><li>Economic pressure: Trump&#x27;s public threat against Iran&#x27;s oil-export infrastructure shows the conflict is reaching economic pressure points, not just battlefield targets. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/14/us-kharg-island-oil-export-hub'>The Guardian</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/iran-war-trump-says-peace-deal-terms-not-good-enough-yet/live-76363921'>Iran war: Trump says peace deal terms not &#x27;good enough yet&#x27;</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/not-good-enough-trump-says-iran-wants-peace-but-us-demands-stronger-terms-first-13989630.html'>‘Not good enough’: Trump says Iran wants peace but US demands stronger terms first</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-trump-rejects-efforts-to-start-iran-ceasefire-talks-sources-say/'>Trump rejects efforts to start Iran ceasefire talks, sources say</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/trump-rejects-efforts-to-launch-iran-ceasefire-talks-sources-say'>Trump rejects efforts to launch Iran ceasefire talks, sources say</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/14/us-kharg-island-oil-export-hub'>Trump says US may strike Iran’s Kharg Island oil export hub ‘just for fun’</a> - theguardian.com</li></ul>